column7:
Overall product is good in 10K bracket, Worth;


  Pros:

  * RAM- 3GB, Good, 99% No Lag;

  * Battery- 5000mAh, No Heating Issue,

  COOL;

  * Sound- Dolby Atmos, Quality is Good;

  * Display Size- 5.5", Good;

  * Charger- 10W= 5.2V 2A, Good;

  * Sensor- Fingerprint, OK;

  * UI- Oxygen OS, similar to 1+ phone;


  Cons:

  * Processor- Mediatek not Snapdragon;

  * Glass- No Corning Gorilla;

  * NFC- No;

  * PPI- 269, so videos appear bit LQ;

  * As usual no Default Apps for Gallery, Music, Video, Recording- have to go for 3rd Party Apps;


  Overall: product will not disappoint you, you won't feel the dearth of cons anywhere (only if you research), if we want all those specs our price bracket will be  [17K]; so Value for Money;



